
### REST Client Test File for User CRUD Operations
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@apiUsers = {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users




### ============================================
### SUCCESS CASES
### ============================================

### 3. Get All Users - Success
# @name getAllUsers
GET {{apiUsers}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. Get User By ID - Success
# @name getUserById
GET {{apiUsers}}/7a1ad21c-4276-4b73-ae33-590f8f8b8889
Content-Type: application/json

### 7. Update User - Success
# @name updateUser
PUT {{apiUsers}}/7a1ad21c-4276-4b73-ae33-590f8f8b8889
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Juan Carlos",
    "lastName": "Pérez Gómez",
    "email": "juan.perez@mail.com",
    "password": "654321",
    "dni": "12345678",
    "phone": "0987654321",
    "role": "ADMIN"
}

### 8. Delete User - Success
# @name deleteUser
DELETE {{apiUsers}}/7a1ad21c-4276-4b73-ae33-590f8f8b8889
Content-Type: application/json

### 9. Delete User - Success (second user)
# @name deleteUserOther
DELETE {{apiUsers}}/2
Content-Type: application/json